    narr:narration """The branch opens with [an initial branch-creation check asserting the omitted-ref behavior, run in late August](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1788169170042_1), and continues with [a verification pass repeating the same assertion in early September](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1788255387470_1) alongside [a parallel-lineage rerun of the identical check landing the same week](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2E2EDefaultRef1788301640261_1). The sequence proceeds through [a further diagnostic pass restating the branch-creation assertion](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1788307540537_1) and [its parallel-lineage counterpart, run the same day and carrying the same wording](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2E2EDefaultRef1788341794428_1), before closing with [the most recent probe, the latest entry in the run, reasserting the same test outcome](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1788429585432_1). Across the sequence, one actor voiced every check.""" ;
